OL,3,AMet was negligent and reckless, sisters
OL,4,Aof 'Putney pusher' suspect tell BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sisters of the man suspected of
OL,7,Fbeing the so-called "Putney pusher"
OL,8,Fhave told the BBC the Metropolitan
OL,9,FPolice was "negligent" and "reckless"
OL,10,Fin its handling of the case.
OL,12,FNicholas Brandram was under suspicion
OL,13,Fof being the jogger who pushed a woman
OL,14,Finto the path of a bus during a run on
OL,15,FPutney Bridge, west London, in May
OL,16,F2017.
OL,18,FHis family said he was innocent and
OL,19,F"took his own life after months of
OL,20,Fimmense pressure" caused by the
OL,21,Finvestigation.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
